       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_sdc_432'), 2, 'Everything happens in get() and in one new private helper. Look at the first await (it has no time limit and no catch), at the await on cache.set (it puts a best-effort write on the response path), and at the direct store.load calls (nothing shares a load that is already running). The breaker exists but is never asked or told anything.'),
